    {
      "source": "Returns whether the underlying <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> has a value (null or non-null) for the\ngiven <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回底层<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>是否针对给定的<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>具有值（null 或非 null）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>property</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>property</code> - 不能为 null。",
