    {
      "source": "Wrapper value object for a <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> to be able to access raw values by\n<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> references. The accessors will transparently resolve nested document values that\na <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> might refer to through a path expression in field names.",
      "translation": "用于访问原始值的<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>包装值对象，通过<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>引用实现此功能。访问器将透明地解析嵌套文档值，这些值可能通过字段名中的路径表达式被<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>所引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Puts the given value into the backing <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> based on the coordinates defined through the given\n<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>. By default, this will be the plain field name. But field names might also\nconsist of path traversals so we might need to create intermediate <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>中定义的坐标，将给定值放入底层<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>中。默认情况下，这将是普通的字段名。但是，字段名也可能由路径遍历组成，因此我们可能需要创建中间层<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Puts the given value into the backing <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> based on the coordinates defined through the given\n<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> 中定义的坐标，将给定值放入其底层文档中。该操作基于通过给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> 所定义的坐标进行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Copies all mappings from the given <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> to the underlying target <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>中的所有映射复制到底层目标<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Copies all mappings from the given <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a> to the underlying target <a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>. These mappings\nwill replace any mappings that the target document had for any of the keys currently in the specified map.",
      "translation": "将给定<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>中的所有映射复制到底层目标<a href=\"../../domain/RowDocument.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>RowDocument</code></a>。这些映射将替换目标文档中当前指定 map 的任何键所对应的所有现有映射。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the value the given <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> refers to. By default, this will be a direct field\nbut the method will also transparently resolve nested values the <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> might refer\nto through a path expression in the field name metadata.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>引用的值。默认情况下，该值为直接字段，但该方法还会透明地解析<code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code>可能通过字段名称元数据中的路径表达式所引用的嵌套值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the value the given <a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a> refers to.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../mapping/RelationalPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalPersistentProperty</code></a>引用的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
